:{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Dragons Legacy is an online creature survival game set in a large, beautiful, sandbox open world with distinct dragons. Rule the world as a Flame Stalker, Shadow Scale, or Acid Spitter Drake!","detailedDescription":"Dragons Legacy is an online dragon survival sandbox game set in a large, beautiful, open world with day/night cycles. Rule the world as one of several dragon species such as the Flame Stalker Dragon, Shadow Scale Dragon, or the Acid Spitter Drake.\n\nFeatures Include:\n\n•     Survive! You come into the world as a hatchling and must eat, drink, survive, and grow to become an adult.\n\n•     Online Steam Multiplayer. Play with other people. Some creatures are players, some are AI. It all takes place on a Dedicated server that you or someone  else is hosting.\n\n•     Huge 16x16km Map. The world is huge and beautiful with forests, grasslands, lakes, canyons, and swamps.\n\n•     Clans. Join your friends or start your own clan complete with clan chat, clan leadership, and other clan features.\n\n•     Special abilities! Some dragons can fly, breath fire, spit acid, and even turn invisible!\n\n•     Growth. Your dragon grows over time. You need to eat and drink to survive to the adult stage. \n\n•     Movement. Dragons can fly, they can swim, they can walk, run, trot, and even sleep! Some can even swim under water!\n\n•     Physics-Based Flight. Experience realistic, physics-based flight that is easy to learn and difficult to master.\n\n•     Fire! Dragons can breathe fire, some spit acid, some shoot plasma. Each dragon species is different and has different stats.\n\n•     Nesting. Dragons can lay eggs which can then be hatched by players, each egg inherits stats from each parent. Or you can spawn into the game with randomly assigned stats. Each dragon will have slightly different stats within the range of its species.\n\n•     End game. The game is more than just growing and surviving. After reaching adult, you can unravel the mystery that will allow your dragon to grow stronger, even larger, becoming an Elder dragon of your species.\n\n•     Friends. Dragons Legacy is a social game where players are able to chat and form groups and clans together.\n\n•     Compatibility. Dragons Legacy runs on Windows and Linux, Laptops and the Steam Deck using older gen hardware.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/header.jpg?t=1726064636"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726064636"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_2517a51d5467b33735cd78a986d162fdf64503f4.600x338.jpg?t=1726064636","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_2517a51d5467b33735cd78a986d162fdf64503f4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726064636"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_84536ecc67db88bb181bba3acaa0a6b8fd3c20db.600x338.jpg?t=1726064636","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_84536ecc67db88bb181bba3acaa0a6b8fd3c20db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726064636"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_134bf9bc138a2b82df1cba3c91399e311c88a42f.600x338.jpg?t=1726064636","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_134bf9bc138a2b82df1cba3c91399e311c88a42f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726064636"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520410/ss_d248539e2ed11041dd4170e5c8e21d54d2233c55.600x338.jpg?t=1726064636","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c